The Waymark Engine is a fork-derived work:

- Its discovery architecture (two-phase symbolic + semantic routing, the verified
  breadcrumb integrity primitives `verifyHop` / `anchorForRange`) derives from the
  Waymark project (https://github.com/paragon-ux/waymark).

- Its Capn chart-store surface, chart file format, and QMD integration derive from
  capn-hook by Cyrus (https://github.com/CyrusNuevoDia/capn-hook),
  Copyright (c) 2026 Cyrus (CyrusNuevoDia), MIT licensed — maintained in this
  ecosystem as the lexical-only fork @paragon-ux/capn-hook
  (https://github.com/paragon-ux/capn-hook).

